Hi Marcus,

Unfortunately GGIR does not facilitate aggregating or splitting files at the moment. Note this is in the "future ideas for GGIR <https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/issues/758>" list. For now, I think I would do as you described, I would use the daysummary output to aggregate the recordings and then calculate the personsummaries from there.

Best,
Jairo

